\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 <!$Scr_H::1><$Scr_H::2>
\f1\b\fs36 1. "Convergence: All Forces Move Toward Sublime Point"\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 	\'95	
\f1\b 	\'95	\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Dunhilton Mobilizes
\f2\b0  - CEO Dunhilton reviews Gerry Hardman's intelligence reports and activates full government forces for assault on Sublime Point. Dunhilton plans to subdue Eloise, believing he can return to eliminating the Elvi later. Unlike Fridge Force, other government agencies remain unaware of the Gyges Disc's true power. Even Agent Jones carries out orders without understanding what he's really hunting.\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\'95	}<!$Scr_H::2>
\f1\b 	\'95	\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Elvi Defenders Prepare
\f2\b0  - The High Elvis mobilizes both Evolution and remaining Gospel Elvi factions, seeing Sublime Point as their holy site where "Holy Momma" will give birth. He assures Eloise they are only there to defend against government forces. Tony reluctantly leads them as "The Great Teacher," outwardly performing his role while privately planning to use the chaos to reach Sarah.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Sages in Conflict
\f2\b0  - Chilo prepares for the final disc activation while Kleoboulos and Solo attempt to sabotage his plans. Their philosophical debate in the facility cafeteria escalates to a physical altercation, witnessed by confused staff members. Solo attempts to warn Chip about Chilo's true intentions, but Chilo intercepts the message.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Sarah's Growing Power
\f2\b0  - Sarah experiences increasingly vivid nightmares that perfectly match the Gyges Disc patterns. During one particularly intense vision, she sees multiple versions of her unborn child across different realities, some benevolent and some terrifying. Kathy stays by her side, monitoring her deteriorating health, while documenting the correlation between her nightmares and temporal anomalies.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Elvi Infiltration
\f2\b0  - Government forces and Elvi defenders engage in a skirmish outside Sublime Point. Kathy convinces Hayley that letting the Elvi into the compound would bolster their defenses: "They're here to protect Sarah. Our goals are aligned. They'll be more effective inside the walls than outside." When Eloise refuses, claiming her defenses are sufficient ("I don't need the clones anymore"), Kathy overrides security protocols. As the Elvi stream in, Alexander, his Candid Criminal crew, and a studio audience disguised in hastily applied sideburns and sequined jumpsuits gain entrance among them. Alexander bribes several Elvi with promises of post-show recording contracts.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0 \cf0 <$Scr_H::2>
\f1\b\fs36 2. "Final Preparations: The Eve of Transformation"\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 	\'95	
\f1\b 	\'95	\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Chip's Last Stand
\f2\b0  - Chip discovers Chilo's plans for dimensional merger during a systems check. Reviewing the Ephesian Prophecy translations, he realizes Chilo has deliberately altered key passages. He attempts to implement final safety protocols and alert Sarah, but Chilo has already manipulated The Johnny into authorizing the pentagram configuration test.\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0
\f0 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\'95	}<!$Scr_H::2>
\f1\b 	\'95	\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Eloise's War Room
\f2\b0  - Eloise monitors the defense of Sublime Point from her command center. She deploys experimental weapons that temporarily disable government forces' communications and vehicles. Hayley assists in coordinating defensive positions, revealing her unexpected strategic abilities. Eloise receives word of Alexander's presence but dismisses it: "Let him film. By tomorrow, he'll be documenting a new world order."\
\ls2\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Gerry's Double Game
\f2\b0  - Gerry Hardman meets with both Dunhilton and Eloise separately, feeding each strategic misinformation. He positions his loyalists throughout the facility, preparing for his betrayal of Dunhilton at the crucial moment. His true objective remains unclear even to his closest allies.\
\ls2\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
The Johnny's Hubris
\f2\b0  - The Johnny assembles the pentagram configuration of Gyges Discs and runs preliminary tests, convinced he can control the dimensional effects. His obsession with impressing Sarah blinds him to Chilo's manipulation. When readings show potentially catastrophic outcomes, The Johnny alters the data before sharing it with the team, determined to be the hero of this scientific breakthrough.\
\ls2\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Sarah's Revelation
\f2\b0  - During a moment of clarity between nightmares, Sarah deciphers part of the pattern language from her visions. She realizes her child isn't meant to collapse reality but to choose which version continues. She attempts to contact Chip with this information but finds communications mysteriously jammed.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

