Alexander's Media Assault
\f2\b0  - Alexander's team sets up a makeshift studio in a detached auditorium within the Sublime Point compound. Technicians hastily arrange lighting and sound while the disguised audience members take their seats. Alexander dispatches his most trusted crew members to locate and "invite" Eloise to be his special guest. He practices his dramatic introduction in a mirror: "Tonight, the mother of all revelations!"\
\ls3\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Tony's Conflicted Mission
\f2\b0  - Tony navigates through Sublime Point, torn between his duties as "The Great Teacher" and his feelings for Sarah. He overhears Elvi followers discussing him as a messianic figure and grimaces with discomfort. When he glimpses Haloren moving furtively through a corridor, Tony becomes suspicious and begins tracking him instead.\
