\f0 \cf0 <$Scr_H::2>
\f1\b\fs36 4. "The Final Hour: Countdown to Midnight"\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 	\'95	
\f1\b 	\'95	\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Candid Criminal Prepares
\f2\b0  - Alexander welcomes his audience to "the finale that will shake reality itself." His warm-up acts include failed Elvi impersonators and comedians making jokes about dimensional collapse without realizing they're describing actual events occurring elsewhere in the facility. Alexander sends his team to "escort" Eloise to the show, promising the audience "judgment day for the most powerful woman in Ulyssia."\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls4\ilvl0
\f0 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\'95	}<!$Scr_H::2>
\f1\b 	\'95	\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Battle and Broadcast
\f2\b0  - Dunhilton watches from his war room as the battle outside Sublime Point unfolds. Government forces deploy increasingly desperate tactics against Eloise's superior technology. As Dunhilton monitors various intelligence screens and the public streamcast, the broadcast is interrupted by triumphant music and a professional voice-over: "We interrupt your family viewing with a special live presentation... A final encore episode of your favorite reality execution show, Candid Criminal!" Dunhilton, apoplectic, smashes a monitor and orders a hoverkopter scrambled to take him to Sublime Point immediately.\
\ls4\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
The Show Must Go On
\f2\b0  - Combat across Sublime Point abruptly halts as soldiers and Elvi alike pause to watch Candid Criminal on their devices. Security forces defending the auditorium become the only active combatants. Inside the studio, Alexander presents his evidence against Eloise: documents proving she engineered the Elvi situation, weaponized the Gyges technology, and manipulated government officials including Dunhilton himself. The studio audience gasps appropriately on cue cards.\
\ls4\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Eloise's Desperation
\f2\b0  - As the execution wheel spins, determining Eloise's fate, she grows increasingly desperate. She offers Alexander anything to stop the broadcast. When he demands to be made CEO of Ulyssia, she immediately agrees: "I can arrange that." Watching from his approaching hoverkopter, Dunhilton curses in seven languages, then orders his pilot to land on the auditorium roof.\
\ls4\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Dunhilton's Ingenious Infiltration
\f2\b0  - Dunhilton, disguised as a Candid Criminal lighting technician (complete with ridiculous false mustache and headset), slips into the backstage area. He believes one final face-to-face confrontation with Eloise will resolve everything, certain his legendary mansplaining abilities will succeed where military force is taking too long. He fears Eloise might actually have the power to replace him with Alexander even during the siege.\
\ls4\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Chilo vs. Chip
\f2\b0  - In the laboratory section, Chip makes his final attempt to stop Chilo from activating the full pentagram configuration. Their confrontation escalates from verbal debate to physical struggle. As they fight over the control tablet, Chip reveals his discovery of Chilo's mistranslations, but Chilo remains unmoved: "Some universal laws transcend mere language." Their struggle represents the conflict between scientific caution and reckless progress.\
\ls4\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Jones and Gerry Near-Miss
\f2\b0  - Agent Jones, stalking through the facility in his chrono-stabilizing suit, nearly encounters Gerry in a corridor junction. Both freeze, duck into doorways, each believing they've avoided detection by the other. This near-miss builds tension for their eventual confrontation at Sublime Point.\
\ls4\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Sarah's First Contractions
\f2\b0  - As the clock approaches midnight on December 25th, Sarah feels the first contractions. The timing perfectly synchronizes with intensifying temporal anomalies throughout the facility. Kathy notices monitoring equipment showing identical wave patterns between Sarah's contractions and dimensional fluctuations, confirming the connection between her child and the cosmic crisis.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

