\f1\b\fs36 5. "Fracture Point: The Threshold of Transformation"\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 	\'95	
\f1\b 	\'95	\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
The Pentagram Activation
\f2\b0  - Chilo succeeds in activating the five-disc pentagram configuration, throwing Chip across the room in the process. Reality begins fracturing visibly as a vortex forms in the test chamber. Through the swirling portal, glimpses of parallel universes become visible - some beautiful, some nightmarish. At the center, a mathematical being composed of pure energy begins to take shape.\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls5\ilvl0
\f0 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\'95	}<!$Scr_H::2>
