The Johnny's Realization
\f2\b0  - As the experiment spirals beyond his control, The Johnny finally understands he's been manipulated. His face drains of color as he watches impossible readings on his monitors: "The dimensional barriers are collapsing completely. This isn't a communication portal\'97it's a merger point!" His epiphany comes too late as reality itself begins to warp around them.\
\ls5\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Sarah's Water Breaks
\f2\b0  - At the exact moment of maximum temporal distortion, Sarah's water breaks. The coincidence sends shockwaves through the temporal field, accelerating the dimensional collapse. Sarah, despite her pain, begins interpreting the mathematical patterns appearing in the air around her. "It's waiting," she gasps to Kathy between contractions. "Waiting for Richard to choose."\
\ls5\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Chip's Technical Solution
\f2\b0  - Though badly injured, Chip activates a partial emergency protocol from his tablet. "I can't stop it," he tells The Johnny, "but I can stabilize it temporarily. Buy us maybe thirty minutes before complete collapse." The vortex pulses but maintains a fixed diameter rather than expanding.\
\ls5\ilvl0
