The Clock Strikes Midnight
\f2\b0  - As December 25th officially begins, reality fractures more severely. Objects exist in multiple states simultaneously. Time flows at different rates throughout the facility. The mathematical being in the vortex grows more distinct, seemingly watching the assembled humans with intelligent curiosity. Sarah's contractions intensify, perfectly synchronized with reality's convulsions. The stage is set for the birth that will determine which version of reality survives.\
